SilphCo_Interior7_Text_OldMan2_1::
	.string "SILPH’s PRES: Oh my...\p"
	.string "We were in troubles, were we?\p"
	.string "Luckily you came to our rescue.\n"
	.string "Thank you!\p"
	.string "Hmmm...\n"
	.string "What’s that?\l"
	.string "You recovered our PROTOTYPE?\p"
	.string "Well, that’s even more impressive!\p"
	.string "Of course, since you became our\n"
	.string "little hero, you should have a\l"
	.string "nice reward.\p"
	.string "So, I’m happy to give you this!$"

SilphCo_Interior7_Text_OldMan2_2::
	.string "SILPH’s PRES: Well, this GHOSTBUSTER\n"
	.string "will reveal hidden ghosts that may\l"
	.string "block your way.\p"
	.string "Unfortunately I don’t really\n"
	.string "know how it works.\p"
	.string "But perhaps someone with\n"
	.string "experience with GHOSTS may know.\p"
	.string "Well, I wish you a safe journey!$"

SilphCo_Interior7_Text_OldMan2_3::
	.string "SILPH’s PRES: Oh, {PLAYER}, feel free to\n"
	.string "visit us anytime you want!$"

SilphCo_Interior7_Text_WorkerM_1::
	.string "I’m the right hand of SILPH.CO’s\n"
	.string "PRESIDENT.\l"
	.string "What an honor, ah?$"

SilphCo_Interior7_Text_WorkerM_2::
	.string "Is that a GHOSTBUSTER?\p"
	.string "Wow, I remember when it was just\n"
	.string "released.\p"
	.string "There was this guy from JOHTO who\n"
	.string "got the prototype for testing.$"

SilphCo_Interior7_Text_Sign1::
	.string "Enjoy SILPH.CO’s latest product.\n"
	.string "The POKéGEAR.$"

SilphCo_Interior7_Text_Sign2::
	.string "SILPH.CO offers guided tours to\n"
	.string "our development floors.$"
